# The minisign the release run signs and verifies the Linux archive with
# (packaging/release-keys.toml's archive key), read by
# tools/ci/minisign_install.sh.
#
# One line: <version> <SHA-256> of the asset minisign-<version>-linux.tar.gz
# on jedisct1/minisign's release tagged with the version; the script
# installs its minisign-linux/x86_64/minisign, a static executable.
#
# Recorded 2026-10-25 for 0.12: the SHA-256 is of the file as downloaded,
# and the file's .minisig verified with the author's published key
# RWQf6LRCGA9i53mlYecO4IzT51TGPpvWucNSCh1CBM0QTaLn73Y7GFO3. A bump
# fetches the new asset, checks the same, and renews this line.
